			"date": "2025-02-14T16:50:44.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> seems sensible to me. i had the thought in the past of using ?tag=another-name, but exposing everything directly is more flexible</p>",
